## Current behavior
I create a form (with mat-form-fields) which I want to initialize as disable but it doesn't work.
It works only if I add setTimeout() of at least ~1000+.
I've tried to disable using:

ngOnInit(): void {
    this.form.disable();
  }

and also:

ngAfterViewInit(): void {
    this.form.disable();
  }

this issue is similar to #22556 but different.


## Expected behavior
The form should be disable.

## Environment
Angular version: 5.2.7
Browser:
- [ x] Chrome (desktop) version XX

